Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before writing code (Chinese: `AGENTS.zh.md`). Procedures live in `docs/skills/`. New HTTP features start with `pnpm ysk-kit add module <kebab-name> --prisma --web`. Do not invent TypeScript enums, import Prisma from clients, or return JSON outside `{ ok, data }` / `{ ok, error }`. Run `pnpm layers && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test && pnpm gen:openapi` before finishing.
